   "note": "GST-2339's published check of the public BEAM items behind published rows."
  },
  "beam-nightly-check": {
   "note": "The same kit and validate.ts run on 2026-11-11 over the 1m-25 items GST-2339 did not list, from BEAM b2da22e files checked against eval/decisions/datasets/beam-b2da22e.json. Its analysis-full.json (ids and gates only) has sha256 41e62f25f6865d1f18d52f68b22f528df71717cc34720cd5d71bfcc9d89cebd2."
  },
  "oracle": {
   "file": "docs/benchmarks/2026-10-08-beam-1m-failure-analysis/arms/a4-oracle-gpt61sol/shard-*/rows.ndjson.gz",
   "note": "The October BEAM arm given every gold session (a4-oracle-gpt61sol, gpt-6.1-sol reader). oracle is pass when its qa_score is at least 0.5, else fail, except that an item whose oracle answer is empty and stopped at the output limit (answer '' and finish_reason length in the arm's answers.ndjson.gz) records no verdict. The arm ran before the 8,192-token output limit, so its fails may include truncation."
  }
